<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>InsureEasy Insurance Management</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#eef4f8}
header{background:#1565c0;color:#fff;padding:16px;text-align:center}
nav{background:#0d47a1;padding:8px;text-align:center}
button{margin:4px;padding:8px 12px}
.card{background:#fff;margin:20px;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px #bbb}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
th,td{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:8px}
th{background:#1565c0;color:#fff}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h1>🛡️ InsureEasy Insurance Management System</h1></header>
<nav>
<button>Home</button><button>User</button><button>Agent</button><button>Admin</button>
</nav>

<div class="card">
<h2>Platform Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>User Registration & Login</li>
<li>Compare Health, Auto & Home Insurance</li>
<li>Policy Details & Premium Information</li>
<li>Purchase Policy (Demo)</li>
<li>Premium Payment (Demo)</li>
<li>Claim Request (Demo)</li>
<li>Policy Renewal Reminder (Demo)</li>
<li>SMS Alert (Demo)</li>
<li>Personalized Policy Recommendations (Demo)</li>
<li>Dashboard for Existing Policies</li>
</ul>

<h2>Admin Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Login</li>
<li>Approve Agent Login</li>
<li>View All Agent Details</li>
<li>View Customer Information</li>
</ul>

<h2>Agent Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Register & Login</li>
<li>Create Customer</li>
<li>Manage Customer Details</li>
<li>Manage Policy Details</li>
<li>Send SMS Alerts</li>
</ul>

<h2>User Features</h2>
<ul>
<li>Login</li>
<li>Manage Policy Details</li>
<li>Receive SMS Alerts</li>
<li>View Premium Due Dates</li>
</ul>

<h2>Sample Policies</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Policy</th><th>Type</th><th>Premium</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Health Secure</td><td>Health</td><td>₹12,000/year</td><td>Available</td></tr>
<tr><td>Auto Protect</td><td>Vehicle</td><td>₹8,500/year</td><td>Available</td></tr>
<tr><td>Home Shield</td><td>Home</td><td>₹15,000/year</td><td>Available</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Note:</b> This is a standalone single HTML demonstration. Payments, SMS, policy approval and claims are simulated. No database is used, so data resets after page refresh.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
